    {"parent": ["International Assistance Programs", "Proprietary Receipts from the Public", -52079000000], "title": "Poland 2024 signed FMS agreements with published package values", "basis": "Official Polish Ministry of National Defence signing-day pages report about $10.0B for Apache, $2.53B net for IBCS, $960M for BARBARA aerostats and $735M for JASSM-ER. These selected signed-package values total about $14.225B but do not reconcile to DSCA's $15.490B FY2024 implemented-transfer value: they are rounded, incomplete, and use agreement rather than Historical Sales Book valuation. Separate source boundary: these rows reconcile only to this panel's published agreement total and must not be added to DSCA transfers, Treasury cash, financing principal, or another panel describing the same acquisition.", "sourceLabel": "Polish Ministry of National Defence", "sourceUrl": "https://www.gov.pl/web/obrona-narodowa/smiglowce-apache", "rows": [["Poland \u00b7 96 AH-64E Apache helicopters", "Signed Aug. 13, 2024 \u00b7 package, logistics, training, ammunition and spares \u00b7 rounded public package ceiling", 10000000000, "https://www.gov.pl/web/obrona-narodowa/umowa-na-96-smiglowcow-uderzeniowych-ah-64e-apache-podpisana"], ["Poland \u00b7 IBCS for WISLA phase II and NAREW", "Signed Feb. 29, 2024 \u00b7 public net package value", 2530000000, "https://www.gov.pl/web/obrona-narodowa/wojsko-polskie-otrzyma-najnowoczesniejszy-system-dowodzenia-obrona-przeciwlotnicza-i-przeciwrakietowa"], ["Poland \u00b7 four BARBARA radar aerostat systems", "Signed May 22, 2024 \u00b7 logistics and supporting elements", 960000000, "https://www.gov.pl/web/obrona-narodowa/aerostaty-barbara-zwieksza-zdolnosci-do-rozpoznania-zagrozen-w-przestrzeni-powietrznej"], ["Poland \u00b7 AGM-158 JASSM-ER missiles", "Signed May 28, 2024 \u00b7 rounded public agreement value", 735000000, "https://www.gov.pl/web/obrona-narodowa/jassm-er"]]},
    {"parent": ["International Assistance Programs", "Proprietary Receipts from the Public", -52079000000], "title": "Poland Apache notification estimate by statutory value class", "basis": "The Federal Register's publication of DSCA Transmittal 23-48 splits the $12.0B maximum notification estimate into $7.5B of Major Defense Equipment and $4.5B of other equipment, training, support, and services. Separate source boundary: these rows reconcile only to this panel's published notification total and must not be added to DSCA transfers, Treasury cash, financing principal, or another panel describing the same acquisition.", "sourceLabel": "Federal Register, DSCA Transmittal 23-48", "sourceUrl": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2024-10-29/pdf/2024-25114.pdf", "rows": [["Major Defense Equipment", "96 AH-64Es; 210 engines; sights, radars, warning systems, radios; Hellfire, JAGM, Stinger and APKWS munitions", 7500000000, "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2024-10-29/pdf/2024-25114.pdf"], ["Other equipment, training and support", "Non-MDE communications, survivability and support equipment; spares; training; technical and logistics services", 4500000000, "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2024-10-29/pdf/2024-25114.pdf"]]},
    {"parent": ["International Assistance Programs", "Proprietary Receipts from the Public", -52079000000], "title": "Israel F-15 notification estimate by statutory value class", "basis": "DSCA Transmittal 24-01 splits the $18.82B maximum notification estimate into two exact statutory value classes, both below $10B. Separate source boundary: these rows reconcile only to this panel's published notification total and must not be added to DSCA transfers, Treasury cash, financing principal, or another panel describing the same acquisition.", "sourceLabel": "Federal Register, DSCA Transmittal 24-01", "sourceUrl": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-11-18/pdf/2025-20065.pdf", "rows": [["Other equipment, integration and support", "Non-MDE protection, communications, software, spares, training, construction, transport and technical/logistics support", 9530000000, "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-11-18/pdf/2025-20065.pdf"], ["Major Defense Equipment", "Up to 50 F-15IA aircraft; engines, processors, radars, navigation pods, launchers, cannons and M-Code devices", 9290000000, "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-11-18/pdf/2025-20065.pdf"]]},
    {"parent": ["International Assistance Programs", "Proprietary Receipts from the Public", -52079000000], "title": "T\u00fcrkiye F-16 notification estimate by statutory value class", "basis": "DSCA Transmittal 23-07 splits the $23.0B maximum notification estimate into exact statutory classes. The $15.3B MDE class is the deepest defensible public monetary ceiling because the notice publishes article quantities but no article-level prices. Separate source boundary: these rows reconcile only to this panel's published notification total and must not be added to DSCA transfers, Treasury cash, financing principal, or another panel describing the same acquisition.", "sourceLabel": "Federal Register, DSCA Transmittal 23-07", "sourceUrl": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-06/pdf/2024-31697.pdf", "rows": [["Major Defense Equipment", "40 new F-16 Block 70 aircraft, 79 modernizations, engines, radars, mission systems and listed missile/bomb families \u00b7 public disclosure ceiling", 15300000000, "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-06/pdf/2024-31697.pdf"], ["Other equipment, integration and support", "Non-MDE communications, protection, software, spares, construction, training, transport and technical/logistics support", 7700000000, "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-06/pdf/2024-31697.pdf"]]},
    {"parent": ["International Assistance Programs", "Proprietary Receipts from the Public", -52079000000], "title": "T\u00fcrkiye current F-16 package estimate after scope reduction", "basis": "T\u00fcrkiye's defence minister told Parliament that the 79 imported modernization kits had been dropped, $1.4B had been paid, and the remaining 40 new F-16 Block 70 aircraft plus munitions would total approximately $6.5B-$7B. The displayed $7B is the upper end of that official public estimate, not an exact contract price, booked U.S. receipt, or amount to add to the earlier $23B DSCA maximum notification.", "sourceLabel": "T\u00fcrkiye Grand National Assembly \u00b7 2025 defence-budget committee report", "sourceUrl": "https://www.tbmm.gov.tr/Haber/Detay?Id=c5cf3733-e5c3-4627-b9ad-01936a3234b8", "rows": [["40 F-16 Block 70 aircraft and munitions", "Approximate $6.5B-$7B current package \u00b7 $1.4B initial payment disclosed \u00b7 79 imported modernization kits removed", 7000000000, "https://www.tbmm.gov.tr/Haber/Detay?Id=c5cf3733-e5c3-4627-b9ad-01936a3234b8"]]},
